    "enUS": {
      "description": "Where have you been, {name}? Hulfdan's been looking all over the place for you. We thought the king may have put you in irons.\n\nGet to Ironforge as soon as possible and speak with Hulfdan!",
      "dialogue": {
        "68fcfcadf644929f82b2": "Keep yer voice down, $N, the guards may hear ye.",
        "926aa2f7b38f0633798f": "Where have you been, $N? Hulfdan's been looking all over the place for you. We thought the king may have put you in irons.$B$BGet to Ironforge as soon as possible and speak with Hulfdan!"
